<!--
Tips for writing a good PLAN:
- Each item should be small enough to finish in one Ralph iteration (~5-15 min
  of agent work). If it's bigger, break it down.
- Prefer vertical slices (a thin end-to-end feature) over horizontal layers
  (all the models, then all the controllers, then all the tests).
- Put the riskiest / most uncertain work early. Cheap wins first feels good
  but hides the hard problems.
- Don't pre-plan everything. The agent will add sub-items as it discovers them.
-->
